# El Alteño — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the real values.
# `.env.local` is gitignored and must NEVER be committed.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Formspree — powers the event reservation form in src/components/sections/Events.tsx
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Without this, the events form POSTs to an invalid URL and fails silently.
#
# How to get it:
#   1. Create a free account at https://formspree.io
#   2. Create a new form (set the notification email to the restaurant's address)
#   3. Copy the form ID from the endpoint URL:
#        https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx   <-- the "xxxxxxxx" part
#
# IMPORTANT: this must also be set in the hosting platform's dashboard
# (Railway → Variables, or Vercel → Environment Variables).
# Variables in this file only apply to local development.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
